Package: apt-cleaner
Version: 1.0-4
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Depends: apt, sudo
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: APT package cleanup tool for KDE Plasma
 Opens a terminal window to run apt-get autoremove --purge and apt-get
 clean, displays a completion status message, and waits for user
 interaction before exiting.
